  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Architectural Refactoring: Shifted core internal components to \"internal\" access, exposing a cleaner and more focused Public API.\n\t\t\t- Simplified Facade Pattern: Unified high-level operations through the \"Lucifer\" facade, reducing complexity for end-users.\n\t\t\t- Advanced Generic Models: Refactored Request and Response models using generic Span-based logic (byte/char), significantly reducing binary size.\n\t\t\t- High-Performance Parsing Engine: Integrated new SIMD-friendly parsing techniques (AbsoluteOffset and Span-splitting) for ultra-fast header processing.\n\t\t\t- Resource Documentation: Standardized file headers and updated copyright metadata across the entire codebase.",
